      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Inline Mask: Crop & Blend\n1. Select your checkpoint and upload the full source.\n2. Choose Crop & Blend and a size preset, then left-click to lock the black dashed frame. Inpaint width/height follow the crop automatically.\n3. Paint inside the empty crop mask and run the workflow.\n4. Inspect Image Compare and click Adopt this result. The patch returns to this crop; Inline Mask has no result input.\n5. Click the blend button to edit the blend mask: paint keeps new pixels and Alt restores original pixels. The repaint mask is retained.\n6. full_image is the current adopted full composite. In blend mode, hold right-click to preview the original. Switch to the repaint mask and right-click or press Escape to merge the visible result and release the selection, then left-click a new area. Hover the bottom controls for instructions."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Inline Mask: Crop & Blend\n1. Select your checkpoint and upload the full source.\n2. Choose Crop & Blend and a size preset, then left-click to lock the black dashed frame. Inpaint width/height follow the crop automatically.\n3. Paint inside the empty crop mask and run the workflow.\n4. Inspect Image Compare and click Adopt this result. The patch returns to this crop; Inline Mask has no result input.\n5. Click the blend button to edit the blend mask: paint keeps new pixels and Alt restores original pixels. The repaint mask is retained.\n6. full_image is the current adopted full composite. Reselect merges it before choosing a new area."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
